<title>USA: Louisville feeder cattle market steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Louisville feeder cattle market steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers steady, compared to last week's close, USDA said.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers - Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs 73.50-80.40; 700-800 lbs 69.00-75.75. Holsteins - Large 2 600-700 lbs 60.00-68.50; 700-800 lbs 36 head 748 lbs 67.70.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers - Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs</p>
<p>67.65-69.00; 700-800 lbs 65.25-69.40.</p>
<p>Cattle and Calves Receipts - 700</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
